# Perl's segmentation boundaries and `\X`, with perl v5.44.0 as the
# oracle. Written by tools/corpus/make_boundary_vectors.py.
#
# The algorithms are gated against the Unicode Consortium's own
# conformance files in tests/unit/test_break.cpp; this is the other
# half, which is what the *dialect* does with them - the ends of the
# subject, the empty subject, and any tailoring Perl applies to line
# breaking, which UAX #14 permits and does not describe.
